OL,3,GNEWSASection of major route to close
OL,4,Afor repair works
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of Welford Road will be
OL,7,Fclosed from next week to allow for
OL,8,Fsewer repairs.
OL,10,FSevern Trent said 24-hour closures
OL,11,Fwould impact the outbound carriageway
OL,12,Fat Greenhill Road from Monday, October
OL,13,F19, with work expected to last five
OL,14,Fdays.
OL,16,FThe closure for lorries will be from
OL,17,FVictoria Park Road as there will be
OL,18,F"insufficient turning space beyond this
OL,19,Fpoint", a spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
